# Paid Tests — AI Must Never Run

Paid tests in `apex_brain/tests/paid/` consume API credits (LLM, etc.). Only the user runs them manually.

**AI (Cursor, Claude, Copilot) must NEVER:**
- Run `pytest apex_brain/tests/paid` or any path including `paid/`
- Set `RUN_PAID_TESTS=1` or any env var to enable paid tests
- Invoke or suggest commands that would execute paid tests

**When running tests after a code change:**
- Use: `pytest` or `pytest apex_brain/tests/unit apex_brain/tests/model`
- Default `pytest` runs only free tests (testpaths excludes paid)

The user runs paid tests manually with: `RUN_PAID_TESTS=1 pytest apex_brain/tests/paid -v`
